# Privacy Policy — BarkodexPOS

**Last Updated:** November 24, 2026  

**Developer:** BiyoTech  

**Contact:** biyoniktech@gmail.com  

BiyoTech ("we", "our", or "us") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your data. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use the **BarkodexPOS** mobile application ("App").

## 1. Information We Collect and Process

BarkodexPOS is designed with an **offline-first** architecture. Your business and inventory records are not uploaded to our servers.

* **Business & Inventory Data:** Products, barcodes, stock levels, sales receipts, expenses, and customer/supplier ledger records you enter are stored locally on your device's internal database.

* **Camera Permission (`android.permission.CAMERA`):** Your device's camera is used strictly in real-time to scan product barcodes for sales and inventory management. No images or video recordings are stored or transmitted.

* **In-App Purchases & Licensing:** All Pro upgrade transactions are processed securely through Google Play Billing. We do not access or store your credit card or financial details. Only purchase tokens and local trial status flags are stored on your device to unlock Pro features.

* **Backups:** Manual backups generated by the user are saved directly to the user's local storage or personal cloud drive at the user's discretion.

## 2. How We Use Information

Data and permissions are used solely to:

* Provide barcode scanning, point-of-sale (POS), stock tracking, and accounting features.

* Verify in-app purchases and manage trial/Pro access.

* Enable user-initiated backup and restore functions.

## 3. Third-Party Services

The App utilizes the following trusted services:

* **Google Play Billing:** For secure in-app purchase processing and license verification.

* **Google ML Kit (Barcode Scanning):** For on-device, offline barcode recognition.

* **Open Food Facts API (Optional):** Used solely to look up public product names by barcode number without transmitting personal information.

## 4. Data Security & Retention

Because your business records reside locally on your device, you maintain full control over your data. Uninstalling the App removes locally stored data unless you have manually exported a backup.

## 5. Children's Privacy

BarkodexPOS is a business utility tool and is not intended for children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

## 6. Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.

